              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Judi Shultz Millan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made these last night to take to a small dinner party and they all loved them and had 2nds and 3rds plus I was asked for the recipe. I did bake them in a 9 x 9 pan so had to bake about 12 to 15 minutes longer. They are delicious and I'm going to make more today. Thanks for the recipe Jo.",
