              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pomplemousse"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good. I liked being able to use up my dried apricots in a delicious recipe. I like thicker squares, so I used an 8x8 pan instead of 9x13. Turned out very well; nice and sweet but not too sweet. I like the mix of coconut and apricots. Since I made it thicker, it probably took another 25-30 minutes to bake.",
